### 9. Risk Management

#### 9.1 Risk Identification & Assessment

| Risk ID | Risk Description | Probability | Impact | Severity | Mitigation Strategy |
|---------|------------------|-------------|--------|----------|---------------------|
| R1 | Qwen AI API unavailable or rate-limited | Medium | High | High | Monitor API usage, implement caching for AI results, have fallback plan (manual moderation or alternative AI service) |
| R2 | Google News RSS feed structure changes | Low | Medium | Medium | Implement robust RSS parsing with error handling, test with multiple news sources, monitor feed changes |
| R3 | Database performance issues with large datasets | Medium | Medium | Medium | Design proper indexes, implement pagination, optimize queries, consider database tuning |
| R4 | Schedule delays due to underestimated complexity | High | Medium | High | Break tasks into smaller chunks, prioritize core features, maintain buffer time in schedule, regular progress reviews with advisor |
| R5 | Integration issues between frontend and backend | Medium | Medium | Medium | Define clear API contracts early, use API documentation tools (Swagger), test integration incrementally |
| R6 | Security vulnerabilities (JWT, SQL injection, XSS) | Low | High | High | Follow security best practices, use parameterized queries, validate inputs, conduct security review |
| R7 | Insufficient test coverage leading to bugs in production | Medium | High | High | Write tests alongside development, aim for 70%+ coverage, conduct thorough system testing |
| R8 | External service dependencies (email/SMS) fail | Low | Low | Low | Implement graceful error handling, provide alternative verification methods, log errors for debugging |
| R9 | Browser compatibility issues | Low | Low | Low | Test on multiple browsers early, use cross-browser compatible libraries, polyfills if needed |
| R10 | Advisor feedback requires major design changes | Medium | High | High | Schedule regular check-ins, get early feedback on design documents, maintain flexible architecture |

#### 9.2 Risk Monitoring

- Review risks weekly during active development phases
- Update risk register if new risks are identified
- Escalate high-severity risks to advisor immediately
- Document risk mitigation actions taken

